    Built on the Fairpicture design system.
    https://fairpicture-design-system.vercel.app/
 
+   Token layer mirrored from the live stylesheet on 2026-11-06
+   (/_next/static/css/d59a2a619e96fcbd.css, 260 custom properties).
+   The design system republished its tokens with numbered ramps
+   (`brand-50…950`, `neutral-0…1000`, one ramp per status hue) and
+   new semantic groups: `state-*`, `interactive-*`, `indicator-*`,
+   `accent-*`. Those names are reproduced here verbatim.
+
    Rules followed here:
    - Product code consumes SEMANTIC tokens only. Every literal
      colour lives in the primitive block below and nowhere else.
    - One brand colour (Fairpicture red). Status colours signal
      status, never decoration.
    - Warm neutrals only. GT Cinetype only. Small radii.
+   - Type is set with a NAMED style (H1–H4 / Body / Body SM /
+     Label / Caption), never a bare font-size. Headings step down
+     one size below 768px, exactly as the design system does.
