+   Legacy aliases: this file predates the republished vocabulary
+   and ~3,000 lines below still consume the old names
+   (`--colour-primary-default`, `--font-size-sm`, `--radius-md`).
+   Section 1b re-points every one of them at the new primitives so
+   the vocabulary is consistent rather than half-migrated, and no
